# Request
sensor_msgs/Image image  # Input image (when use_image is true)
string text              # Input text (when use_image is false)
bool use_image           # Set true to embed the image, false to embed the text
---
# Response
float32[] embedding      # Embedding vector returned by SigLIP base
bool success             # True if the embedding was computed successfully
string message           # Human-readable status or error message
